2026-08-28 local novel-peptide validation
Inputs: 4 MGF files; 196 candidate peptides; 147506 human UniProt+isoform entries; 116 cRAP entries.
Search constraints: precursor 10 ppm; fragment 0.6 Da; trypsin, <=2 missed cleavages; precursor z=2..6; CID/HCD b/y ions (z=1..3); fixed CAM[C] and TMT11[K,N-term]; variable Ox[M].
Checks: 9,453,368 reference tryptic peptide forms considered; no candidate had an exact reference tryptic peptide match.
Validation: best candidate spectrum scores were compared with the supplied human+cRAP reference search space; 129 candidates passed the target-over-reference check.
Deliverable: final_answer/verified_peptides.tsv (129 peptides, 135 unique peptide-protein pairs).
